WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.367
Pocket Daily is a calm e-book reader for iPhone, iPad and Mac.

00:00:04.567 --> 00:00:08.833
Start reading right away, free and without an account.

00:00:09.033 --> 00:00:13.450
Pages turn instantly, like paper.

00:00:13.650 --> 00:00:18.067
Choose a Paper, White or Night page, and the font, size and margins that suit you.

00:00:18.267 --> 00:00:22.367
Add EPUB, text or Markdown files to your Library.

00:00:22.567 --> 00:00:26.667
Your place follows you to your other devices through your own iCloud.

00:00:26.867 --> 00:00:30.750
Collect good articles from the share sheet or RSS feeds.

00:00:30.950 --> 00:00:34.833
Read them later, offline and without clutter.

00:00:35.033 --> 00:00:42.933
If you have an X3 or X4 e-paper reader, design its Home screen and preview exactly how the reader will draw it.

00:00:43.133 --> 00:00:46.683
Send books and articles straight to your reader over Wi-Fi or Bluetooth.

00:00:46.883 --> 00:00:50.433
Nothing passes through a cloud.

00:00:50.633 --> 00:00:54.183
No account, no ads, no tracking.

00:00:54.383 --> 00:00:57.933
Start today's page with Pocket Daily.
